 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4922730/extras/2a7b9b014e162f21a9460eba47f18e6e.avif?t=1789250567\" width=780 height=6046 /></span></p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4922730/extras/2a7b9b014e162f21a9460eba47f18e6e.avif?t=1789250567\" width=780 height=6046 /></span></p>",
 "short_description": "Demons want Earth. Bad idea. Smash them back to Hell in a chaotic pixel-meets-3D roguelike of absurd, game-breaking builds. With heroes like a holy Knight, a Corn-Launching Robot, or a Wizard Girlie and her ferocious cat. Play solo or 4-player online co-op. Commence the slaughter. Send Them To Hell.",
 "supported_languages": "英语<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言",
