 "pc_requirements": {
  "minimum": "<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i3-4130 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> GeForce GTX 460 / Radeon HD 5770 / Intel HD 4000 (OpenGL 3.3)<br></li><li><strong>网络:</strong> 宽带互联网连接<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 2048 MB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>声卡:</strong> Any Windows-compatible audio device<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> Requires an OpenGL 3.3 capable GPU. Java runtime is bundled. Internet connection required for online co-op only.</li></ul>",
  "recommended": "<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 8192 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 / Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>网络:</strong> 宽带互联网连接<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 2048 MB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>声卡:</strong> Any Windows-compatible audio device<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> 1080p / 60+ FPS at High settings. Online co-op for 2–4 players over Steam.</li></ul>"
 },
